(LEGAL-014 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: Tamil Nadu WRD Northeast Monsoon Tank Safety, Patrol & Flood Regulation Sta) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Assistant Engineer \(WRD\), Executive Engineer & District Disaster Management Authority) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Chapter 3, Clause 3.4 \(Monsoon Storage & Freeboard Rules\)) Tj T*
(When a non-system or system tank reaches 80% of Full Tank Level \(FTL\) during heavy) Tj T*
(Northeast Monsoon rainfall forecasts, the Assistant Engineer \(WRD\) must deploy) Tj T*
(24x7 Lashkar/Kavalarkarar bund patrols, stock sandbags at vulnerable bund reaches,) Tj T*
(and clear all obstructions in the surplus weir \(kalingal\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Chapter 4, Clause 4.2 \(Three-Stage Flood Warning Protocol\)) Tj T*
(When tank inflow causes water level to touch FTL and surplus discharge begins over) Tj T*
(the weir, the WRD Executive Engineer and Revenue Tahsildar must issue First,) Tj T*
(Second, and Third Flood Warnings to downstream habitations before operating flood) Tj T*
(regulators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
